---
import ServicePage from '../layouts/ServicePage.astro';

const description = "DUET provides advanced, biology-forward care for individuals living with Ménière's disease, vertigo, tinnitus, fluctuating hearing loss, and balance disorders, using modern diagnostic technology and personalized treatment.";

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'MedicalCondition',
  name: "Ménière's Disease",
  description,
  url: 'https://duethearing.com/menieres-disease/',
};
const businessService = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Service',
  name: "Ménière's Disease Care",
  serviceType: 'MedicalService',
  provider: { '@id': 'https://duethearing.com/#organization' },
  areaServed: { '@type': 'City', name: 'Lake Forest, Illinois' },
  audience: { '@type': 'MedicalAudience', audienceType: 'Patient' },
  description,
  url: 'https://duethearing.com/menieres-disease/',
};

const allSchemas = [schema, businessService];

---
<ServicePage
  pageTitle="Ménière's Disease | Duet Hearing"
  description={description}
  parentLabel="Hearing &amp; Tinnitus"
  currentLabel="Ménière's Disease"
  pageHeading="Ménière's Disease Treatment &amp; Advanced Audiology Care"
  sidebarImage="/s9-card-4.jpg"
  schema={allSchemas}
>

  <p class="service-intro">Research-Based Care for Ménière's Disease</p>

  <section class="service-block">
    <p>At DUET, we provide advanced, biology-forward care for individuals living with Ménière's disease, vertigo, tinnitus, fluctuating hearing loss, and balance disorders. Our research-based clinic programs are designed to evaluate the full auditory and vestibular system using modern diagnostic technology and personalized treatment strategies.</p>
    <p>Ménière's disease is a complex inner ear condition that can affect hearing, balance, sensory processing, and quality of life. Symptoms may include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Episodic vertigo</li>
      <li>Hearing fluctuations</li>
      <li>Tinnitus or ringing in the ears</li>
      <li>Ear fullness or pressure</li>
      <li>Sound sensitivity</li>
      <li>Cognitive fatigue and sensory overload</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Because symptoms often change over time, effective care requires more than a standard hearing test. Our clinic uses a precision audiology approach focused on identifying how Ménière's disease uniquely affects each patient's hearing, vestibular function, communication, and daily performance.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block">
    <h2>Our Innovative Audiology Approach</h2>
    <p>DUET combines:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Advanced hearing and balance diagnostics</li>
      <li>Vestibular and auditory system evaluation</li>
      <li>Precision hearing technology</li>
      <li>Tinnitus management strategies</li>
      <li>Longitudinal symptom tracking</li>
      <li>Research-informed clinical protocols</li>
      <li>Personalized care pathways</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Our goal is to help patients better understand their condition while improving hearing clarity, communication ability, balance confidence, and overall quality of life.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block">
    <h2>Advanced Testing for Hearing &amp; Balance Disorders</h2>
    <p>We offer comprehensive evaluations for patients experiencing:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Ménière's disease</li>
      <li>Vertigo and dizziness</li>
      <li>Tinnitus</li>
      <li>Fluctuating hearing loss</li>
      <li>Vestibular dysfunction</li>
      <li>Sound sensitivity</li>
      <li>Ear pressure and fullness</li>
      <li>Complex auditory symptoms</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Using evidence-based audiology and vestibular assessment methods, we develop individualized recommendations tailored to each patient's symptoms and lifestyle needs.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block">
    <h2>Personalized Care for Complex Hearing Conditions</h2>
    <p>No two cases of Ménière's disease are exactly alike. That is why our clinic programs are designed around individualized assessment, ongoing monitoring, and adaptive treatment strategies that evolve with the patient over time.</p>
    <p>At DUET, we believe modern hearing and balance care should be:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Research-driven</li>
      <li>Technology-enabled</li>
      <li>Biology-forward</li>
      <li>Patient-centered</li>
      <li>Outcome-focused</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block">
    <h2>Why Patients Choose DUET</h2>
    <p>Patients seeking advanced care for Ménière's disease and vestibular disorders choose DUET for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Specialized expertise in complex hearing and balance conditions</li>
      <li>Modern diagnostic technology</li>
      <li>Personalized treatment planning</li>
      <li>Comprehensive tinnitus and hearing support</li>
      <li>A science-driven, innovative care model</li>
      <li>Compassionate, high-touch patient experience</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="service-block">
    <h2>Schedule a Comprehensive Ménière's Evaluation</h2>
    <p>If you are experiencing vertigo, tinnitus, hearing fluctuations, or balance concerns, DUET offers comprehensive evaluations designed to provide clarity, answers, and personalized solutions.</p>
    <p>Discover a modern approach to hearing and vestibular care grounded in biology, research, and innovation.</p>
  </section>

  <p class="service-outro">If Ménière's disease is affecting your quality of life, schedule a comprehensive evaluation at DUET Hearing Preservation today.</p>

</ServicePage>
